VITE_DEV_API_PROXY_TARGET=http://127.0.0.1:8000

# Multi-tenancy, local. The frontend resolves the shell from the Host header
# at runtime (see lib/tenancy.ts) — nothing per-domain is baked into the
# build. Browsers send every *.localhost name to 127.0.0.1 with no hosts-file
# entry, so dev works exactly like production:
#   http://admin.localhost:5173   → master control
#   http://{slug}.localhost:5173  → that tenant's app
# (Match the backend's TENANCY_CENTRAL_SUBDOMAIN in backend/.env.)
